# Vercel deployment exclusions for RPL
#
# Live data files are LOCAL ONLY.
# They are never uploaded to Vercel on any deployment.
# The only data Vercel sees is src/data/seeds/, which is
# promoted intentionally by running: npm run data:publish
#
# This means a deployment can NEVER overwrite or corrupt
# the data you are actively working with locally.

src/data/*.json

# Development tooling not needed on Vercel
scripts/
*.mjs
